---
// 關於分頁:頭像、自述、聯絡方式。
import Panel from './Panel.astro';
import { links } from '../../data/site';
---

<Panel id="about" title="關於" sub="COOK" size="sm">
  <div class="about">
    <img class="avatar" src="/images/cook.jpg" alt="酷可" />
    <div class="text">
      <p>做遊戲,也做讓別人能做遊戲的東西。</p>
      <p>從 2021 年到現在,九個遊戲同一個世界、兩代視覺小說引擎、三個編輯器。
        題材換得很開,但底下都是 2D、TypeScript、自己寫的系統。</p>
      <p>也畫圖。</p>
      <ul class="contact">
        {links.map((l) => (
          <li><a href={l.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{l.name}</a></li>
        ))}
        <li><a href="mailto:b43096022@gmail.com">b43096022@gmail.com</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Panel>

<style>
  .about {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }
  .avatar {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 104px;
    height: 104px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 2px solid rgba(232, 180, 99, 0.4);
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 14px), calc(100% - 14px) 100%, 0 100%);
  }
  .text p {
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
  }
  .contact {
    margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.1rem;
  }
  .contact a {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #e8b463;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(232, 180, 99, 0.35);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
    transition: border-color 140ms;
  }
  .contact a:hover {
    border-color: #e8b463;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
